WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.571 --> 00:00:10.712
It snowed all night.

2
00:00:11.473 --> 00:00:13.374
The snow piled higher and higher.

3
00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:15.716
First, it covered the grass.

4
00:00:16.597 --> 00:00:18.318
Then, it covered the bushes.

5
00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:21.321
By morning, it even covered the cars.

6
00:00:21.341 --> 00:00:24.423
"Rich and Paul!

7
00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:25.964
No school today!"

8
00:00:26.285 --> 00:00:26.965
called Mom.

9
00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.547
"Did you hear that?"

10
00:00:28.907 --> 00:00:30.148
Rich asked his brother.

11
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.742
"Wow, no school!"

12
00:00:33.162 --> 00:00:33.942
shouted Paul.

13
00:00:37.885 --> 00:00:40.107
Rich and Paul love snow days.

14
00:00:40.687 --> 00:00:42.488
They don't have to go to school.

15
00:00:43.129 --> 00:00:44.830
Snow days are never boring.

16
00:00:45.471 --> 00:00:47.212
There are so many things to do.

17
00:00:51.495 --> 00:00:54.037
First, Paul and Rich make snow angels.

18
00:00:54.677 --> 00:00:57.379
They find a place in the snow with no footprints.

19
00:00:58.019 --> 00:01:01.438
Carefully, Rich and Paul lie down in the snow.

20
00:01:03.839 --> 00:01:05.420
"Spread your arms and legs.

21
00:01:06.181 --> 00:01:09.182
Move them up and down like this," says Rich.

22
00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.685
When they stand up, they can see angel shapes in the snow.

23
00:01:13.705 --> 00:01:17.588
"Ha-ha-ha!" they laugh.

24
00:01:18.948 --> 00:01:22.010
Next, Paul and Rich decide to go sledding.

25
00:01:22.531 --> 00:01:24.312
They both have a fast sled.

26
00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.682
"Let's race," says Rich.

27
00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:31.944
"Sure! Are you ready?"

28
00:01:32.524 --> 00:01:33.225
says Paul.

29
00:01:33.245 --> 00:01:36.287
"Ready, set, go!"

30
00:01:37.568 --> 00:01:38.829
They race down the hill.

31
00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:43.553
They go faster and faster: "Aaaaaaaah!"

32
00:01:46.595 --> 00:01:48.797
"I'm the winner," says Paul.

33
00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:51.139
"Do you want to go one more time?"

34
00:01:55.382 --> 00:01:57.124
I declare war!"

35
00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:58.261
yells Rich.

36
00:01:58.281 --> 00:02:00.522
"Wait!" shouts Paul.

37
00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:03.024
Rich hits Paul with a snowball.

38
00:02:03.044 --> 00:02:05.986
"I'm not ready," says Paul.

39
00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.068
Rich hits Paul with another snowball.

40
00:02:10.389 --> 00:02:11.770
They have a snowball fight.

41
00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:15.152
Rich and Paul hit each other with many snowballs.

42
00:02:15.652 --> 00:02:17.093
They get covered in snow.

43
00:02:17.774 --> 00:02:21.116
Then Rich hits Paul with a really big snowball.

44
00:02:21.676 --> 00:02:22.857
It is a fun war.

45
00:02:22.877 --> 00:02:25.959
"Do you want a truce?"

46
00:02:26.419 --> 00:02:27.180
Rich asks.

47
00:02:27.948 --> 00:02:29.169
"Okay, truce.

48
00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:30.269
What's next?"

49
00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.311
"How about building a snowman?"

50
00:02:33.331 --> 00:02:35.272
"Sounds great!"

51
00:02:35.812 --> 00:02:36.553
says Paul.

52
00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:40.815
Rich and Paul roll a very large snowball.

53
00:02:41.496 --> 00:02:44.077
Then they roll a medium-size snowball.

54
00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:46.699
They lift it on top for the body.

55
00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:49.540
The boys roll a small snowball.

56
00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.222
Then they put it on top for the snowman's head.

57
00:02:54.303 --> 00:02:56.184
Rich gets coal from the garage.

58
00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.861
Paul runs into the house and gets a carrot and a hat.

59
00:03:00.641 --> 00:03:04.163
They give their snowman eyes, a mouth, and a nose.

60
00:03:05.123 --> 00:03:07.124
Mom comes out to see the snowman.

61
00:03:07.924 --> 00:03:08.544
"Look, Mom!

62
00:03:08.864 --> 00:03:10.065
We built a snowman.

63
00:03:10.745 --> 00:03:11.505
What do you think?"

64
00:03:11.885 --> 00:03:12.565
says Paul.

65
00:03:12.585 --> 00:03:14.106
"It's great!"

66
00:03:14.566 --> 00:03:15.286
Mom says.

67
00:03:15.306 --> 00:03:17.827
"You have played for a long time.

68
00:03:18.547 --> 00:03:20.008
It's time to come in now."

69
00:03:22.524 --> 00:03:26.627
The boys go into the house and take off their jackets and scarves.

70
00:03:27.248 --> 00:03:29.590
Then they sit by the fire to warm up.

71
00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:33.393
"I hope it snows again tonight," says Rich.

72
00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:36.115
"Another snow day would be great!"

73
00:03:36.615 --> 00:03:37.476
agrees Paul.
